        </div>

        <div class="bg-white/5 border border-white/5 rounded-2xl p-8">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white mb-3">How do I convert YouTube to MP4 for free?</h3>
          <p class="speakable-answer text-white/60 leading-relaxed" data-speakable="true">To convert YouTube to MP4 for free: 1) Copy the YouTube video URL, 2) Paste it into TubeToMP4 at yutubetomp4.online, 3) Select your preferred video quality (720p, 1080p, or 4K), and 4) Click download. The MP4 file saves directly to your device with no registration required.</p>
