          <p class="speakable-answer text-white/60 leading-relaxed" data-speakable="true">Downloading YouTube videos as MP4 using TubeToMP4 is safe. All file transfers are encrypted, no personal data is collected, and no software installation is required. The service runs entirely in your browser. Always ensure you have the right to download content for personal use.</p>
